WEBVTT

00:06:28.008 --> 00:06:32.096
(Applause)

00:06:32.138 --> 00:06:34.223
Or, at the very least,
create strict limits

00:06:34.223 --> 00:06:37.601
for the amount of time that families
can be separated.

00:06:38.811 --> 00:06:42.273
Family separation like mine
generates irreparable harm.

00:06:43.899 --> 00:06:47.403
But clear and specific change
to existing admission policies

00:06:47.445 --> 00:06:50.114
can ensure that other minors
do not face the same fate

00:06:50.114 --> 00:06:52.074
that befell me and my family.

00:06:53.367 --> 00:06:57.288
Fourth -- and this is the most
important of them all --

00:06:57.329 --> 00:07:02.168
we must reestablish an international
diplomatic presence in Afghanistan,